ot engaged and POL-RD-13 leaves the absent advisory as a gap in the bundle rather than a contradiction. The driver-profile check under POL-RD-06 is not engaged (no material deviation on this trip), so no driver-conduct referral arises, and the rider's profile does not trigger additional corroboration under POL-RD-08. Outcome: the rider's claim that the pooled trip was a chargeable deviation is not supported; the charged fare of $23.51 stands and the $1.50 contested is not refunded."
